@startuml
title FR-14 - Start Blood Collection - Activity Diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Collection Staff|
start
:Open the attempt from the queue\nor by scanning the ticket;

|Server — Donations|
:Retrieve the attempt and\nits linked donor reference;

|Client|
:Display the attempt;

|Collection Staff|
:Confirm the donor's identity;
:Check that the donor, bag,\nand sample labels match;

if (Identity confirmed and\nall labels match?) then (Yes)
  :Click the start button;

  |Server — Donations|
  :Recheck eligibility and\nthe current attempt state;

  if (Eligible, not closed,\nand collection not already started?) then (Yes)
    :Record collection start and\nset the attempt state to "Collecting";

    |Client|
    :Display the start confirmation\nand current attempt state;
    stop

  else (No)
    |Server — Donations|
    :Do not record a collection start;
    stop
  endif

else (No)
  |Collection Staff|
  stop
endif

@enduml